  "date_building_work_completed_under_previous_permission": null,
  "lapsed_date": "18/08/2029",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The proposed residential units, by\r\nreason of their failure to provide any form of private amenity space and the\r\nlack of adequate outlook and light levels for the bedrooms of Flat 3, 4, 7 and\r\n8 along with the lounge of Flat 8 would result in an inappropriate internal\r\ndesign and result in a poor quality of living accommodation to the detriment of\r\nthe residential amenities of the future occupiers of these units, contrary to\r\nthe National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policy GR1 of the Harrow Local\r\nPlan (2021-2041) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document Residential\r\nDesign Guide (2010).&amp;nbsp;&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The proposal,\r\nwith the provision of 1- and 2-bedroom residential dwellings along with HMO\r\naccommodation, fails to provide an appropriate dwelling mix to meet the housing\r\nneeds of the borough. As such, the proposal is contrary to London Plan (2021)\r\npolicy H10 and Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) policy HO1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The proposal, specifically the refuse\r\nand cycle store areas surrounding the main building entrance would &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;result in a layout that would encourage\r\nanti-social behaviour and result in poor crime prevention due to the number of\r\nhidden areas which are accessible from the street. As such, the proposal is contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policies\r\nGR1 and GR3B of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) and the adopted Supplementary\r\nPlanning Document Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
